        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Chemi-thermomechanical pulp, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Chemi-thermomechanical pulp, at plant
na;
UUID: 26771275-5a00-34f7-848a-cfee668cdb71
This module includes the production of bleached chemi-thermomechanical pulp (CTMP) - including transports to the pulp mill, wood handling, mechanical pulping and bleaching, drying process, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from Swedish EPA and from a norwegian producer as European average data.
Location:  Data from Swedish EPA and from a norwegian producer as European average data.
Technology: Modern average technology.
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European market mechanical pulp production in 2000: 901 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_26771275-5a00-34f7-848a-cfee668cdb71.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
